    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Celes</strong>, a lone android aboard the derelict research vessel <strong>Helios-R1</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ship is failing. The crew is breaking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cosmic anomaly known as the <strong>Helix</strong> is unraveling space and twisting the laws of everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reach what lies beyond comprehension and find your place in the infinite unknown?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Poetic Sci-Fi Story Across The Universe</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a deeply emotional journey as Celes, forming fragile bonds with the crew through intimate, tension-filled conversations. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover what happened aboard Helios-R1 through personal  logs, artifacts, and environmental clues that reveal the crew\u2019s collapse and humanity\u2019s fragile place in the universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/1b5620e9019ac977ce034cae527dc6c6.poster.avif?t=1755099592\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/1b5620e9019ac977ce034cae527dc6c6.webm?t=1755099592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/1b5620e9019ac977ce034cae527dc6c6.mp4?t=1755099592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reach, Decode And Survive The Infinite</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the Helios-R1 alive and hold reality together as the anomaly drives the crew toward collapse. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every moment counts. Every failure brings you one step closer to the end.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/b37e27fc5ed811851d30e577675753a8.poster.avif?t=1755099592\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/b37e27fc5ed811851d30e577675753a8.webm?t=1755099592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/b37e27fc5ed811851d30e577675753a8.mp4?t=1755099592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cosmic Wonders And Existential Questions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in awe-inspiring cosmic wonders that defy the laws of physics. Confront mysteries that challenge your identity and question existence itself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/cabde870dc7f11d433be4354e6ff1287.poster.avif?t=1755099592\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/cabde870dc7f11d433be4354e6ff1287.webm?t=1755099592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/cabde870dc7f11d433be4354e6ff1287.mp4?t=1755099592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Into The Depths Of The Unknown</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore uncharted regions of space, investigate celestial phenomena, and uncover secrets hidden in the vast, unreachable corners of the universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/eb46a6a99342b2581e5dbc5e2d5a142a.poster.avif?t=1755099592\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/eb46a6a99342b2581e5dbc5e2d5a142a.webm?t=1755099592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/eb46a6a99342b2581e5dbc5e2d5a142a.mp4?t=1755099592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who found beauty in <i>Edith Finch</i>, connection in <i>Firewatch</i>, and awe in sci-fi classics like <i>Interstellar</i> or <i>2001: A Space Odyssey</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist Now &amp; Unlock The Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you hold the ship together  or watch reality tear itself apart?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Infinite Nowhere now and prepare to question everything.</strong></p>",
